    delphi:hasConfidence "0.72"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "Many published observations make cross-population tests possible, but the key fear and persecution variables require substantial compilation. Causal acquisition speed remains difficult to isolate." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Relate flight-initiation distance or approach tolerance across populations to quantified duration and intensity of human persecution, controlling for body size, urbanization, and phylogeny. Increasing fear with exposure supports the claim." ;
